---
// Problem/Solution Section
---

<section class="problem-solution">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid">
      <!-- Problem Column -->
      <div class="problem-column">
        <div class="column-header">
          <span class="column-label label-problem">The old way</span>
          <h3 class="column-title">Traditional photography holds you back</h3>
        </div>

        <ul class="issue-list">
          <li class="issue">
            <strong>Studio shoots cost €5k+</strong>
            <p>Traditional photography is expensive, time-consuming, and you wait weeks.</p>
          </li>

          <li class="issue">
            <strong>Inconsistent brand aesthetic</strong>
            <p>Different photographers, different styles — your brand looks scattered.</p>
          </li>

          <li class="issue">
            <strong>Limited angle variations</strong>
            <p>Can't easily test new markets or product angles without another expensive shoot.</p>
          </li>

          <li class="issue">
            <strong>Manual editing &amp; revisions</strong>
            <p>Endless back-and-forths. Revisions cost extra money and burn time.</p>
          </li>

          <li class="issue">
            <strong>Can't scale fast</strong>
            <p>Seasonal updates, new products, new markets — it all takes months to execute.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Solution Column -->
      <div class="solution-column">
        <div class="column-header">
          <span class="column-label label-solution">The VISUAILS way</span>
          <h3 class="column-title">Studio quality, on demand</h3>
        </div>

        <ul class="solution-list">
          <li class="solution">
            <strong>€19–35 per image</strong>
            <p>10x cheaper than traditional shoots. Scales with your growth.</p>
          </li>

          <li class="solution">
            <strong>On-brand consistency</strong>
            <p>AI learns your aesthetic. Every visual matches your brand perfectly.</p>
          </li>

          <li class="solution">
            <strong>Unlimited angle variations</strong>
            <p>Test new angles, new markets, new seasons — generate as many variations as you need.</p>
          </li>

          <li class="solution">
            <strong>3 revision rounds included</strong>
            <p>No surprises. Revisions are built-in, not an extra fee.</p>
          </li>

          <li class="solution">
            <strong>Scale instantly</strong>
            <p>Need 500 images for a new product line? Done in 5 days instead of 5 months.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-solution {
    padding: 120px 0;
    background: #F8F9FA;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 72px;
  }

  .problem-column,
  .solution-column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .column-header {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .column-label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .label-problem { color: var(--accent-warning); }
  .label-solution { color: var(--accent-success); }

  .column-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    max-width: 22ch;
  }

  .issue-list,
  .solution-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .issue,
  .solution {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .issue { border-left-color: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.4); }
  .solution { border-left-color: rgba(0, 170, 68, 0.5); }

  .issue:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent-warning);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(26, 32, 44, 0.06);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .solution:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent-success);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0, 170, 68, 0.08);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .issue strong,
  .solution strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .issue p,
  .solution p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 56px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .problem-solution {
      padding: 72px 0;
    }

    .grid {
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .column-title {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }

    .issue,
    .solution {
      padding: 16px 18px;
    }
  }
</style>
